    ],
    "numeric_environment": [
      "x86 little-endian SSE2 binary32 and CVTSS2SD binary64 conversion; nearest-even rounding, FTZ=DAZ=0, masked FP exceptions.",
      "Arithmetic and bit-selection operand order are retained. NaN payload/sign and signed zero survive the selection masks; MAX/MIN select their second operand for unordered/equal lanes.",
      "The unknown x87 return is not reconstructed: its rounded FSTP32 word is supplied explicitly. FP flags, traps and non-default rounding/environment are excluded."
